# Lava Burst's "if Lava Burst would deal damage to a creature" is judged where the damage would be dealt as each effect
# applies (CR 616.1f). Bot2's Ornithopter wears With Great Power . . . ("all damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to
# enchanted creature instead"), a 2/4 with it, and has Healing Salve's "prevent the next 3 damage" on it. Bot1's Lava Burst
# with X 2 at Bot2 may be redirected - damage to a player can be - and is dealt to the Ornithopter, where it is damage to a
# creature and can't be prevented: the Ornithopter has 2 damage marked and Bot2 is at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Lava Burst
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
With Great Power . . .
Healing Salve
Island x12

